{"ref":"BDB, רָזֶה","hw":"רָזֶה","html":"† <big>[<span dir=\"rtl\">רָזֶה</span>]</big>  <strong>adj. lean (</strong>on formation cf. Lag<sup>BN 49</sup><strong>)</strong>;—fs. <span dir=\"rtl\">רָזָה</span>, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 34:20\" href=\"/Ezekiel.34.20\">Ez 34:20</a> (of <span dir=\"rtl\">שֶׂה</span>; opp. <span dir=\"rtl\">בִּרְיָה</span>), of land, = barren, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 13:20\" href=\"/Numbers.13.20\">Nu 13:20</a> (JE; opp. <span dir=\"rtl\">שְׁמֵנָה</span>).","next":"BDB, רָזִי","prev":"BDB, רָזָה"}